1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:14,124
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is October thirtieth. Winter is coming early in northern Japan, with the first snow of the season. Let's listen.

2
00:00:14,724 --> 00:00:17,675
[News] 今日のニュースです。

3
00:00:18,376 --> 00:00:28,551
